---
title: Secvența 1 – telemetrie care depășește pragul și produce o alarmă
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER as :PeriodicTelemetryTask
    participant SEN as :TemperatureSensor
    participant Q as alarmEvents :BlockingQueue
    participant SPO as :SporadicAlarmTask
    participant B as :Broker MQTT
    participant MPT as :MessageProcessor (telemetry)
    participant MPA as :MessageProcessor (alarm)
    participant CSV as :CsvStorage
    participant DB as :Dashboard

    Note over PER: eliberare r_k = r_0 + k·T
    PER->>SEN: read()
    SEN-->>PER: 29.41
    PER-)B: publish(.../device-1/telemetry, "device-1#59;ts#59;29.41")
    B-)MPT: "device-1#59;ts#59;29.41"
    MPT->>CSV: append("telemetry", mesaj)
    MPT->>DB: updateTelemetry("device-1", 29.41)
    Note over PER: 29.41 > prag 28.00
    PER-)Q: offer(AlarmEvent(ts, 29.41, 28.00))
    PER->>PER: sleepUntil(r_k + T)
    Q-->>SPO: take() → eveniment
    alt au trecut ≥ 5000 ms de la ultima alarmă
        SPO-)B: publish(.../device-1/alarm, "device-1#59;ts#59;29.41#59;28.00")
        B-)MPA: "device-1#59;ts#59;29.41#59;28.00"
        MPA->>CSV: append("alarm", mesaj)
        MPA->>DB: updateAlarm("device-1", 29.41)
        Note right of MPA: afișare imediată:<br/>*** ALARMĂ device-1 ***
    else < 5000 ms (interval minim între sosiri încălcat)
        SPO->>SPO: eveniment RESPINS (nu se publică)
    end
